hwui's Movie and PdfDocument on the host flavor, as Android registers them (the Unity test APK probe's gap sort, category 2).

The host flavor leaves jni/Movie.cpp with GIFMovie and MovieImpl, and jni/pdf/PdfDocument.cpp, to the device's
sources, as layoutlib does without giflib and with its own PDF path. Android's libhwui builds them and registers
android.graphics.Movie (GIFs over external/giflib's libgif) and android.graphics.pdf.PdfDocument (over Skia's PDF
backend, which the host flavor builds already). So the host target takes the four sources and libgif, and
LayoutlibLoader's map and its list of patch 0006 gain both classes, in the device's gRegJNI order. PdfEditor stays
out: it needs libpdfium, and no taken class names it.

